Subject: CVE-2026-102554 — bump bundled Guava to 33.7.2-jre

Gradle 8.14.6 pins Guava 33.4.6-jre in the distribution dependency platform.
Maven Central ships 33.7.2-jre with the fix for CVE-2026-102554. Bump the
distribution platform pin, add j2objc signing key C3259 to verification-keyring.keys,
extend trusted keys for jspecify, and adapt Guava 33.7 API/Error Prone fallout.

Tracker: https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-102554
CVE: CVE-2026-102554
Origin: DHI-internal (bundled Gradle dependency bump)
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/gradle/gradle.git 88c80c1459b75a6d077d24eebe7905ffa3e1293f
Verify: cmd `patch -p1 --dry-run` expect "checking file"
Forwarded: not-needed (no upstream Gradle commit yet)
Drop-When: dependency com.google.guava:guava >= 33.7.2-jre

